One approach would be to use plotmath, something like:
     my_title <- expression(paste("Mean Suitability in Anonymous National\nPark for",italics(species)i, "by Year"))
Plotmath lets you include many mathematical symbols as well as italicize, underline, superscript & subscript in title & label strings.

?expression and ?plotmath and perhaps googling "plotmath ggplot2" should get you what you need.

Tom Philippi
