MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

My recommendation would be to avoid the `qplot()` function and switch to `ggplot()`.

Something along the lines of:

ggplot(AbuAfiMz, aes(x = TEPais, y = AbuAfiMz)) +
   theme_bw() +
   geom_point() +
   geom_smooth(method = "gam", formula = y ~ s(x))

Cheers,
Roman

