I should also mention that Hadley just released ggplot2 version 2.0.0 and one of the major things he did was update the documentation so that it does not have so many … references. It does not look like the package documentation updates made it over to docs.ggplot2.org <http://docs.ggplot2.org> yet, so I would also suggest just using the package documentation as well, e.g.,

update.packages("ggplot2”) # make sure you have version 2.0.0
library(ggplot2)
?geom_line # or whatever you are curious about

